      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "be598cc0d56e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "FAQs – Study in the UK from Nepal"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c1476809c264",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ddc5975d0aa8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "1. What are the English requirements for Nepali students?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c08c3fbe1218",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ec992f9e307a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Most UK universities require IELTS 6.0 – 6.5, but alternatives like PTE or TOEFL are also accepted."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d434d6f5dbd4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "942300faad6a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "2. Can I study in the UK without IELTS?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "bd22b064f073",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "112ebf3d965f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, some universities accept Nepali students with MOI (Medium of Instruction) proof."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "82701311692d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b96d40215ca8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "3. What is the UK student visa success rate for Nepali students?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "90fe1b0315f9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "36f1616d3afd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "It is generally high if you submit all required documents correctly."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8144cf0ca5c6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f52cfc192482",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "4. Can I take dependents with me?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c9f1135a4abf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c794a8eaa409",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, postgraduate students can bring dependents if they meet visa requirements."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b8bb5f4ef9c5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2970fe621a48",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "5. Is studying in the UK expensive?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6b80566edb3f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "957c3a8924ee",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "It depends on your course and city. With scholarships and part-time jobs, it becomes affordable."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c6286fa67e31",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "25b96ea62b0f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "6. Can I stay in the UK after graduation?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c32e33b404c0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7bbaf3abbb5b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, with the Graduate Route Visa, you can stay for 2–3 years to gain work experience."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a5c7ab3181b8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "de798fc032ed",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "7. Which are the best universities for Nepali students?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2418c2e4a970",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "52d4cce5445d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Oxford, Cambridge, University of Manchester, Birmingham, and Leeds are popular choices."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e5e096d68d3e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "82f22a804026",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "8. How early should I apply for UK universities?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "25967e0a0658",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f3b39d9ea879",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "At least 6–12 months before your course start date."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "84dfcf7ebcf6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "970aa450441a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "9. Do UK universities offer January intakes?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3adcb62e3f3c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "67f4031f0ba9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, many UK universities have both September and January intakes."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "947bbc931d97",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e269be824f8b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
